            "Score What Is Live against the New Version",
            "Get Sign-Offs",
            "Sweep for What Was Missed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "process": "ref/mkt/brand-voice",
          "activities": [
            "Turn the Voice into Scorable Rules",
            "Score Old Material against the Draft Rules",
